  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "blk_6f89ec89",
      "type": "text_title",
      "text": "优胜的秘法",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 1,
        "source_type": "文本标题",
        "source_row": 2,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b53dda69",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "相处中，总会有这种人的吧，虽然还没开始或者从没做过，但如果是她的话，就觉得一定能做得到。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c9a5c821",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "秧秧就是会给人这种感觉的人。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_0e2cd5ae",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "“秧秧她……似乎什么都能做好“，这份笃定的信任，大概来自于过往的实例。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_16782f20",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "自小成绩优异，礼、乐、书、数、武……各科教考每年总是名列前茅，如遇上新的知识点或难题，也是不露惧色，积极尝试。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 6,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_010c616a",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "一年一度的学院评优，秧秧总会是上台发言的代表之一。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 6,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 7,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_23dbe84e",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "但大家所不知的是，秧秧在发言之前，也会按着虎口小小吸气平复紧张的心情，每一次开始或尝试，她都不是抱有完全的把握的。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 7,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 8,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8a4fa5ac",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "要说感悟事理，秧秧的确算有些天赋，但那点天赋在真正的天才面前不过尔尔，常人会遇到的问题她也都没法幸免。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 8,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 9,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_aadaddb8",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "第一次修行剑道，她因收不住挥剑的力气险些栽倒，更别提完整地舞出一套剑招。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 9,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 10,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_de168e83",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "可越是还不够好，越是要尽力做好。自那之后的两个月里，她每日练习一百下，不断请教更为优秀的前辈师长，毫不避讳地展现自己的不足，再以一种近乎自省的态度，继续每日一百下练习，完善他人指出的不足。如此这般，肌肉适应了酸痛，她已能和人打上几个来回。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 10,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 11,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_f2c1506b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "而再两个月后，在教考剑道的考场，秧秧便又一次拔得头筹了。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 11,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 12,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_99d9efb0",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "也有人不忍见秧秧如此辛苦，劝慰她道，“人生嘛，哪有那么多的完满，大家的肯定和称赞也已足够，不做到那么好也是可以的吧？”",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 12,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 13,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_9e23707f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "这种时候，秧秧总是先笑着谢过对方的好意，再摇摇头以作拒绝。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 13,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 14,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_68c222d9",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "不行呐，少女所求并不是他人的嘉奖，她不是要与旁人争个高低，而是近乎执拗地和自己较着劲。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 14,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 15,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_00f7508c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "是不是真的竭尽全力？是不是每个环节都做到了做到了当下范围内的最好，没留下任何遗憾、无愧于心呢？",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 15,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 16,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_70e6c73a",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "“不愧是秧秧，果然啊……就知道你没问题！”",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 16,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 17,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_56b5593b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在秧秧成为踏白，查出并帮着解决残象区域性聚集异常后，人们一如既往给予了她这样的评价。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 17,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 18,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_a989aa1c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "这一次的确如此，但是下一次……需要努力的地方还有很多，没能掌握的东西也还有很多，再去请教下夜归的前辈们，该如何做得更好吧？",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 18,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 19,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b3700d29",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "想成为被笃定信任着的人，要付出难以想象的努力。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 19,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 20,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c8e6c209",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "不过，既然是秧秧认定的事情，无论会多辛苦，她都会不遗余力。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 20,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 21,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_efe4561c",
      "type": "text_title",
      "text": "倾听的秘法",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 22,
        "source_type": "文本标题",
        "source_row": 23,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_5681ab38",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "大多数人不知道的是，秧秧有着绝对音感。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 23,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 24,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_3abcdf03",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "这或许是因为秧秧从未主动在人前演唱过，又或许是因为大部分时候，她都退居角落，将舞台让给他人，似乎她生来就只适合担当倾听的角色。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 24,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 25,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_38a4924f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "所以当秧秧精准地哼唱出只听过一遍的旋律时，炽霞惊讶地瞪大了眼睛，“这，这么快就……而且，还唱得这么好听！”",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 25,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 26,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c240c614",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "恍然间，大家这才想起秧秧的另一重身份，声乐世家的二小姐，不通乐理、不懂歌唱什么的才说不过去吧。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 26,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 27,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_6a643c66",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "秧秧的这一身份，让原先的部分困惑合理了起来，那恰到好处的待人处事，那再严苛的人挑不出错误的礼节，原是这么个渊源。但随即，更大的困惑涌上众人心头，世家的小姐放弃原有的优渥安稳、只身来到边境，是有什么非这样不可的缘由吗？",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 27,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 28,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_d2bd3a27",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "偏偏从没听秧秧提起过，踏白出勤还是日常相处，她没推脱过什么，也没抱怨过辛苦。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 28,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 29,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_0a0a29fa",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "真要说起来，反倒是他们麻烦她更多，因为……她总是在听他们说。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 29,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 30,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_69446484",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "有时人们不断讲述，所求并不是对错或者解法，只是想找个方法将郁结的情绪宣泄出去。秧秧深知这点，所以并不预设立场，而是怀着平常心，理解每一位讲述者当下的感受和需要。对方诉说，她并不打断，只在卡壳或为难时出声提示一二，然后又继续到静静聆听的状态。于是乎，那些原本理不顺、掰不清的情绪不知不觉就豁然开朗，一次倾诉真正发挥了功效。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 30,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 31,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_1135aca4",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "当然，倾听绝不是一味的附和，如需建议，秧秧也从不吝啬，但她给出建议的首要原则，便是以当事人意愿为先。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 31,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 32,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_bacda22b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "炽霞的一番宣传，让众人好奇不已，都打趣秧秧什么时候给大家唱上一首。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 32,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 33,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_d6d2cb74",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "秧秧却很是不好意思地摆摆手拒绝，“还是……等之后准备好的时候再唱给你们听吧？”",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 33,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 34,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_ce4c1084",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "秧秧神情恳切，想来并不是敷衍或托词，而是发自内心真的这么想。只是，那是什么时候呢，恐怕……是要等所有想要被聆听之人统统说完吧？",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 34,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 35,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_efdc967d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "能听懂他人演绎并给出建议的，自身也一定是通晓乐理之人。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 35,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 36,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_4ac8741e",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "但自身精通，未必就要登台献艺，能聆听也是好差事啊，少女这样想着又退后两步，将舞台让给了她觉得真正需要的人。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 36,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 37,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_536b39d0",
      "type": "text_title",
      "text": "相信的秘法",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 38,
        "source_type": "文本标题",
        "source_row": 39,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_f3e2747e",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "从某种程度来说，十六岁的秧秧和六岁时的秧秧相比，并没有太大的差异。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 39,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 40,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_d7018a2c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "她还是对世界抱有同样的期许，一如既往地相信童话，相信人与人之间的善意，相信奇迹，相信一切美好终会发生。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 40,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 41,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_59cba3a7",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "有人说，这种侥幸的天真，是没吃过生活苦头的宠儿才会有的想法。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 41,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 42,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8d95abb9",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "的确，秧秧的成长没多少苦难的参与，优渥的家境、疼爱她的家人，她天然就被隔绝在相对幸运的那一边，顺遂地长大。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 42,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 43,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_19052e28",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "但并不是没体会过。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 43,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 44,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_7b88632b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "十一岁那年，名为现实的暴雨，顺着偶然撕裂的缝隙，开始斜进她世界的一角。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 44,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 45,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_5a62ed21",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "蛰伏已久的流放者袭击了家中的商队，秧秧还没来得及消化死亡、人类对待同胞的残忍，就开始了逃窜。她流落到某个不知名的村庄聚落，聚落贫瘠，靠自己的双手在野外活下来的人瘦削精干，惊魂未定间，秧秧分不清他们与那群穷凶极恶的歹徒是不是同类。对面同样警惕又戒备，他们用试探的眼神紧盯衣着华丽又独自一人的秧秧，疑心这是一个陷阱。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 45,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 46,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_83dcb381",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "但最终她还是接过了他们递来的、她从没见过的食物。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 46,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 47,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_f31e02a5",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "最贫瘠的地方也滋生着善意，秧秧想回报他们率先给出的信任，但她的学识在野外派不上用场，她的剑法在真正的敌人面前又太过稚嫩。她与周边的一切如此格格不入，偏偏这一切或许才是大多数人需要面对的真实，而这真实如此苦涩，看不见尽头。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 47,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 48,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_305ad98a",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "“阿婆，你们……一直这样生活嘛？”秧秧帮聚落里的阿婆一起清点着并不宽裕的物资，忍不住问出这个略显突兀的问题。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 48,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 49,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_da131e3e",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "“咋啦，城里来的小丫头，被吓到了？放宽心，等到以后啊，就好咯。”",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 49,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 50,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_ce8fd22a",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "“那要到多久以后呢？真会有那样的以后吗？”",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 50,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 51,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_50d49384",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "“当然有，要是你自己都不相信，那还怎么成真？就像那时候，我们也不敢保证你不是坏人嘛。人呀，总要试着先去相信些什么，知道结果了才信，那叫个屁的相信啊！”",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 51,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 52,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_980e4662",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "“至于多久……喏，就你们长大以后吧。“",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 52,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 53,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_2cd2ce62",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "所以，或许秧秧行至此刻的生命中还没有经历足够的苦难，但又或许，期许与否并不取决于一个人的经历，而是一个人的本性。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 53,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 54,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_af1cd64e",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "就是会有人在最贫瘠的时候，因一份近乎于期许的相信，释放善意，而他们的身体力行，又催生出一份新的期许。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 54,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 55,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c8e01720",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "从那之后，面对陌生未知的人和事，秧秧会率先一步给出信任。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 55,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 56,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_627c8a9c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "当然，她的交付不是毫无底线，一旦发现对方辜负了这份信任，和煦的轻风也会化为划破长空的利刃。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 56,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 57,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_4ae09c3c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "只是相信的心是一切的开始，先抱有美好的期许，再设法使这样的期许成真，这正是使世界不再变糟的万千方式中，她所选定的那一种。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 57,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 58,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_87cee61f",
      "type": "text_title",
      "text": "风教会她的",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 59,
        "source_type": "文本标题",
        "source_row": 60,
        "xlsx_section_index": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_59b2f98b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "秧秧曾三次于风中坠落。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 60,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 61,
        "xlsx_section_index": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_bc3074b1",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "第一次，是从母亲悠荡起的怀抱里。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 61,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 62,
        "xlsx_section_index": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_4b661c6c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "彼时秧秧刚诞生于人世不久，被爱意包围，母亲将小小的她放在臂弯间晃荡，玩着假装腾起又假装落地的游戏。一次更为用力的晃荡，母亲一时不察，竟真的让她短暂腾空。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 62,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 63,
        "xlsx_section_index": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_9ad0564f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在通晓人言之前，秧秧先一步听懂了风的秘语，不过半臂距离的下落，她竟于无形中察觉到暴雨将至的潮湿。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 63,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 64,
        "xlsx_section_index": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_7283a15c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "秧秧咿咿呀呀，众人皆当她是因刚刚的意外受了惊吓，却无人想到，其实那是因为片刻后来临的一场风雨。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 64,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 65,
        "xlsx_section_index": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_6b897731",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "第二次，是因为过载而陷入昏厥。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 65,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 66,
        "xlsx_section_index": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_d5ef0395",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "随年岁渐长，原先那种朦胧的感应，已经变成一种可被感知的精准传达。无形的气流便在秧秧她掌间汇聚，被她称做“流息”，大到能量的波动、异常的先兆，小到一个人的服饰、肢体动作、甚至语气中的沉默，凡是暴露在风场中，她都能有所感知。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 66,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 67,
        "xlsx_section_index": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_bbbc0e22",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "但也是因此，秧秧陷入了一种误区，她不愿辜负这种能力，总想着多感知一些……但秧秧越是想把一切纳入考量，就越迷失在茫茫细节中。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 67,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 68,
        "xlsx_section_index": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_4bb361eb",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "将后来发生的事归为坠落，也许并不准确，因为衡量它的维度不是距离，而是时间。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 68,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 69,
        "xlsx_section_index": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_306363d3",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "由过载而带来的负荷，断断续续地持续了数个月之久，浑浑噩噩间，秧秧几乎以为自己只是是被风挟裹的一片落羽，要永无止尽地向下坠去，直到——“面面俱到，面面皆失，我真正该做的……是在限度之内找准真正的关键“，如同顿悟一般，少女为自己划下了停歇的落点。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 69,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 70,
        "xlsx_section_index": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_7974a311",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "第三次，但或许不是最后一次，是秧秧主动跃起，拥风入怀。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 70,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 71,
        "xlsx_section_index": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_5522d659",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "当过载在发间留下不可逆转的印记，秧秧也彻底摆脱了过载的负荷。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 71,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 72,
        "xlsx_section_index": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_276816cc",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "流息依旧反映着冗杂的细节，但感知者却学会集中于所需的一点，筛选出真正有用的信息。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 72,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 73,
        "xlsx_section_index": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_699065df",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "失踪处挣扎的痕迹，城郊外异常的波动，持续增强的能量反应……秧秧从没在如此急迫的情况下感知过，但她决意先不管结果的好坏，只纯粹地采取想要采取的行动。 流息涌动，逐渐汇聚成明确唯一的线，而那线所指向的尽头，正是失踪孩童的身影——被残象紧逼，她惶惶然就要跌落山崖，顾不得思索，秧秧跃向崖底，朝她伸出了手。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 73,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 74,
        "xlsx_section_index": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_5c73c6ca",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "雀羽飘荡，气流飘荡的轨迹构成风场，轻柔却有力地托住了坠落的少女和孩童。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 74,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 75,
        "xlsx_section_index": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_2acedac1",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "孩童看着四散的羽毛，惊喜地拍着小手，“姐姐，你是会在风中飞飞的雀鸟仙人吗？”",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 75,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 76,
        "xlsx_section_index": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_659bcaa4",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "秧秧怔愣，在想起那些与风交缠的过往后浅笑，大概……真是如此吧。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 76,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 77,
        "xlsx_section_index": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_828913fe",
      "type": "text_title",
      "text": "答案在风中",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 78,
        "source_type": "文本标题",
        "source_row": 79,
        "xlsx_section_index": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_11b2b925",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "离家远行的路上，秧秧曾见过这么两类人。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 79,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 80,
        "xlsx_section_index": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_19c8ae5b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "一类行色匆匆，却不知道自己为什么奔忙，最终迷失在路途之中，悻悻而返。而另一类，他们目标明确，哪怕偶有停歇、绕了远路，也总能抵达终点。秧秧望了望不远处依稀可见的今州城，不确定自己可否算作第二类，但这两类人的存在让她不置可否，又一次想起那个叫做“一生一器”的词。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 80,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 81,
        "xlsx_section_index": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_05898130",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "一生一器，是秧秧家学中的最重要一条，本意为家中成员尽可以无所不长，但需择定一种乐器为专，终其一生不断修练，成为此间大拿。后随事局变化，渐渐衍生为一生只为一事，砥砺至极致，以求不枉此生。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 81,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 82,
        "xlsx_section_index": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_ef57b993",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "母亲的“器”，应该就是制曲，秧秧见过大家在母亲的曲子中欢兴起舞，而姐姐，也已经能在商会独当一面了。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 82,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 83,
        "xlsx_section_index": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_eddca19c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "但秧秧却无法像她们那样轻易地做出决定，什么样的事才值得献上一生？她到底该孩成为什么样的人？",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 83,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 84,
        "xlsx_section_index": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_26e3cbe1",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "她向母亲求助，您希望我继承家业吗？或者说，您希望我做什么呢？我什么都可以一试，也一定会将尝试做到极致，人生虽有无限可能，但终究也只能选择其中一条吧？",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 84,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 85,
        "xlsx_section_index": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_952a95d3",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "母亲慈爱地看向她，孩子，正因如此，你才不该从我这寻找答案，而是该问一问自己的心，这本就是很难的问题，你不必着急。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 85,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 86,
        "xlsx_section_index": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_f6942b99",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "于是，秧秧将这个问题放在心里，积压了很久很久。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 86,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 87,
        "xlsx_section_index": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_263bd9ee",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "久到她从贫瘠聚落重新返回家中，从永无止尽坠落再度爬了回来，久到她终于厌倦了家境的庇佑，想要走入她曾见过的其他人群里，如他们一样感悟世界的坎坷。她不想再只是轻薄一片，她想要变得充满份量，想要真实将她侵染。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 87,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 88,
        "xlsx_section_index": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_aef255a6",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "野外突然袭击，前线因残象损失惨重的消息传回城里，哀戚、愤恨、绝望……情绪在聚集的人群中翻涌，仿佛下一秒就将滚沸。大家就着篝火，不止是谁先起的头，低沉的男声、沙哑的女声，大家抽噎着哭得厉害，但在第二日清晨就恢复如初了，悲伤变得奢侈，而秧秧没有具体的失去，她因他们的哭泣而流泪。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 88,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 89,
        "xlsx_section_index": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c565a1a8",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "他们悲恸的泪光与被救下的孩童的笑容交相闪过，所有经历种种融会贯通，终于让她意识到自己想要成为怎样的人——她想要保护他人，如同曾被保护的自己一样，让他们免受不幸，让他们既可以放声哭泣，也可以期许美好。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 89,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 90,
        "xlsx_section_index": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b450c4f5",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "授资加入踏白的那个夜晚，秧秧独自来到今州城的最边缘，她仰望天空，也俯瞰生活着的居民，她询问自己，这城市如此鲜活，自己是否真能如自己所想，拥有保护他们的力量？",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 90,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 91,
        "xlsx_section_index": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_a445efaf",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "流息从远方涌来，将少女轻柔地拥入怀中，拂去她最后一丝疑虑。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 91,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 92,
        "xlsx_section_index": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_9b583484",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "它告诉她，今州城，是世家二小姐秧秧的终点，但却只是踏白成员秧秧的起点。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 92,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 93,
        "xlsx_section_index": 4
      }
    }
  ]
}